Modifications
-------------
Each upstream stencil XML file was converted into a Thinoda stencil package
(JSON, deflate-compressed) by the Thinoda draw.io stencil translator
(translator revision 1, bundle revision 1). The original XML source is
stripped from the bundled definitions; geometry, styles and connection points
are re-expressed in Thinoda's stencil format.

Regenerate with:

    cargo run --release -p thinoda-io --example drawio_stencil_bundle -- <drawio stencils xml dir>
